                                        "entry_id": "d459249f-91b2-3ed5-b03e-9c4c081e7a80",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A nation lying between potentially hostile nations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e24d137-6011-4b30-90c9-d6e9dedd7ad7",
                                                "sense_id": "f90fe293-6091-31af-ba0c-b03c26bac435",
                                                "text": "The conflict was finally settled in 1828 with the creation of the buffer state of Uruguay, but the prestige of the emperor had suffered a further blow as a result of this reverse, as it was perceived."
                                            }
